&lt;li&gt;Build systems and tooling to improve automation, visibility, and threat detection across security and infrastructure teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct security architecture and design reviews for systems, applications, and network environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the deployment, configuration, and maintenance of security tools and controls across cloud and on-prem environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently drive security initiatives and foster a security-first mindset across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with partner teams to review designs and use-cases, ensuring environments are secure by design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming ability in one or more general purpose languages (Python, Go, Rust, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with one or more infrastructure as code languages (e.g., Terraform, AWS CDK) in a production capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in AWS, Azure, or GCP ecosystems and security tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting security architecture or design reviews for applications and network environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of modern adversary tradecraft and defensive mitigation strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms and deploying applications through CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and implementing defensive controls across network, endpoint, and cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work autonomously, take ownership of complex projects, and collaborate across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have participated in or supported incident response events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible to obtain and maintain a U.S. TS clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building bespoke solutions in high-growth, high-complexity environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with log aggregation, secrets management, or endpoint security tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with Linux operating systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with network-based defensive controls in corporate and industrial production environments&lt;/li&gt;
