&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Partner cross-functionally (Clinical Development, Translational Biomarkers, IT) to support&amp;nbsp;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;linical program compliance and sponsor oversight&amp;nbsp;and safety database validation and system compliance (e.g., 21 CFR Part 11)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
