&lt;p&gt;Toast creates technology to help restaurants and local businesses succeed in a digital world, helping business owners operate, increase sales, engage customers, and keep employees happy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Corporate Tax Manager, you’ll be responsible for the global income tax provision and the US income tax compliance lifecycle, along with other projects.&amp;nbsp; This is a high-visibility role on a lean, high-performing team. You’ll work closely with senior leadership, external advisors, and cross-functional partners — with your work flowing directly into our SEC filings and financial statements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a technically excellent tax professional who brings deep ASC 740 expertise and the curiosity to modernize how we work — leveraging AI-assisted tools and automation to evolve traditional tax processes in a fast-moving, public SaaS environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A day in the life (Responsibilities)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the preparation and review of the quarterly and annual ASC 740 provision, including current and deferred tax analysis, uncertain tax positions (ASC 740-10 / FIN 48), valuation allowance assessment, and effective tax rate (ETR) analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document and test income tax-related internal controls over financial reporting (ICFR) in partnership with Internal Audit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the preparation of the federal consolidated return and state/local income tax returns, Globe information returns, extensions, and estimated tax payments — primarily through external advisors — ensuring timely and accurate filing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critically evaluate advisor work product to ensure returns reflect the company’s tax positions, elections, and planning strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage responses for federal and state income tax notices and audits; coordinate with external counsel, and maintain contemporaneous documentation of tax positions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor legislative and regulatory changes affecting multi-state apportionment, nexus positions, and estimated tax obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with internal and external stakeholders on stock-based compensation tax accounting (ASC 718), R&amp;amp;D credit studies, transfer pricing calculations, and the tax implications of corporate transactions and M&amp;amp;A activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare/review tax account reconciliations for monthly accruals related to above-the-line tax items, and manage the journal entry process with accounting and F&amp;amp;S.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement opportunities to leverage generative AI, automation, and data transformation tools to improve efficiency across tax research, data collection, and recurring workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other ad hoc projects on an as needed basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need to thrive (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of progressive corporate income tax experience with a mixture of Big 4 public accounting background and in-house experience; experience with a public company profile strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid hands-on experience in ASC 740 US GAAP income tax accounting, including deferred taxes, stock-based compensation (ASC 718), uncertain tax positions (ASC 740-10), and valuation allowance analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of US GAAP to Local GAAP, Local GAAP to Local Tax concept.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting or Finance; CPA license preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of US federal income tax, multi-state apportionment, nexus, and estimated tax management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who is able to work with a distributed workforce, be self-reliant and motivated to take on tasks and demonstrate the ability to work with service providers to drive tasks and projects to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High proficiency in Excel; comfort with or active interest in data transformation tools (e.g., Alteryx, Power Query) or AI-assisted tax workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, confident communicator who can translate complex tax concepts for senior leadership and non-tax stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will help you stand out (Nonessential Skills/Nice to Haves)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with tax provision software — ONESOURCE Tax Provision, CorpTax, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in Taxation (MST) or MBA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Pillar Two / BEPS 2.0 and global minimum tax analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with transfer pricing in a SaaS or technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ERP systems (e.g., NetSuite, SAP) and financial close processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in using AI tools, such as ChatGPT, Gemini and/or Claude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at Toast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Toast, one of our company values is that we&#39;re hungry to build and learn. We believe learning new AI tools empowers us to build for our customers faster, more independently, and with higher quality. We provide these tools across all disciplines, from Engineering and Product to Sales and Support, and are inspired by how our Toasters are already driving real value with them. The people who thrive here are those who embrace changes that let us build more for our customers; it’s a core part of our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Total Rewards Philosophy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to provide competitive compensation and benefits programs that help to attract, retain, and motivate the best and brightest people in our industry. Our total rewards package goes beyond great earnings potential and provides the means to a healthy lifestyle with the flexibility to meet Toasters’ changing needs. Learn more about our benefits at &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/toast-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/toast-benefits&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;https://careers.toasttab.com/toast-benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this role is listed below. The starting salary will be determined based on skills, experience, and geographic location. In addition to base salary, our total rewards components include cash compensation (overtime, bonus/commissions if eligible), equity, and benefits. You can learn more about how we align pay with local labor markets in our &lt;a class=&quot;in-cell-link&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/us-pay-zones&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Geographic Pay Zone Philosophy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$128,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$205,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How Toast Uses AI in its Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Throughout the hiring process, our goal is to get to know you. We use AI tools to support our recruiters and interviewers with tasks like note-taking, summarization, and documentation of interviews to ensure they can be fully focused on your conversation. All hiring decisions are made by people. To learn more: &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/ai-in-hiring&quot;&gt;https://careers.toasttab.com/ai-in-hiring&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Approach to Hybrid Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We embrace a hybrid work model that fosters in-person collaboration while valuing individual needs. Our goal is to build a strong culture of connection as we work together to empower the hospitality community, regardless of location. Please visit the Locations page on our career site to learn more about our in-office expectations by region:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-link&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/locations-toast&quot;&gt;https://careers.toasttab.com/locations-toast&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion is Baked into our Recipe for Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Toast, our employees are our secret ingredient—when they thrive, we thrive.&amp;nbsp;The restaurant industry is one of the most diverse, and we embrace that diversity with authenticity, inclusivity, respect, and humility. By embedding these principles into our culture and design, we create equitable opportunities for all and raise the bar in delivering exceptional experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;We Thrive Together&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We embrace a hybrid work model that fosters in-person collaboration while valuing individual needs. Our goal is to build a strong culture of connection as we work together to empower the restaurant community. To learn more about how we work globally and regionally, check out: &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/locations-toast&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/locations-toast&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://careers.toasttab.com/locations-toast&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Toast is committed to creating an accessible and inclusive hiring process. As part of this commitment, we strive to provide reasonable accommodations for persons with disabilities to enable them to access the hiring process. If you need an accommodation to access the job application or interview process, please contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:candidateaccommodations@toasttab.com&quot;&gt;candidateaccommodations@toasttab.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;------&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For roles in the United States, it is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

